A training checklist marks a parcel as eligible for the automated chute only when all of the following hold:
- its seal is intact;
- its barcode is readable;
- its width is less than 18 cm.
A readable barcode alone is insufficient. A parcel exactly 18 cm wide fails the width condition, even if it meets the other requirements. The checklist describes eligibility, not a promise that an eligible parcel has already been dispatched.
